{
    "name": "styledbarcode-web",
    "widgetName": "StyledBarcode",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Barcodes for Mendix powered by bwip-js: 60+ symbologies (Code 128, GS1-128, EAN/UPC with add-ons, Code 39/93, ITF-14, Codabar, DataMatrix, PDF417, Aztec, GS1 DataBar, postal codes...), GS1 element string builder, human readable text options, colours, rotation, border, save as base64 to an attribute, SVG/PNG/JPEG/WEBP export, copy, print, ZIP and label-sheet PDF for lists and encoding validation.",
